{"title":"Career Roadmap: Research Analyst","role":"Research Analyst","summary":"A Research Analyst in International Studies/Diplomacy researches political, economic, security and social developments and converts information into structured analysis.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts - General / Honours)","Course":"International Studies / Diplomacy"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build skills in international affairs, geopolitical research, data analysis, policy research, writing, intelligence analysis and evidence-based decision-making"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Research Analyst in International Studies/Diplomacy researches political, economic, security and social developments and converts information into structured analysis."},{"type":"p","text":"Potential areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"International relations"},{"text":"Geopolitics"},{"text":"Foreign policy"},{"text":"Diplomacy"},{"text":"International organizations"},{"text":"Global economics"},{"text":"Security studies"},{"text":"Strategic affairs"},{"text":"Conflict and peace studies"},{"text":"Regional studies"},{"text":"International development"},{"text":"Trade and economic diplomacy"},{"text":"Political risk"},{"text":"Public policy"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The graduate should not assume that \"Research Analyst\" automatically means intelligence or diplomatic service. Those are distinct career pathways with different recruitment and eligibility requirements."}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof of Skill","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"International affairs foundation"},{"text":"Political science, history, economics, IR"},{"text":"Country/region research brief"},{"text":"Memorizing current affairs"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"te